{"asset_key":"ep8/quest_story_18205020","episode":"ep8","category":"quest_story","story_id":"18205020","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1820502001:1":{"text":"...","source_cn":"……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4D94AD9463C9058","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1820502002:0":{"text":"...?","source_cn":"……？<key:dialog6>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDC29F8833C93C788","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1820502003:0":{"text":"...그, 그러고 보니 지금 이 모습, 우리 어릴 때랑 비슷하지 않아?","source_cn":"……说，说起来，现在的情景像不像我们小时候？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x39DEB500CF06B2F9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1820502004:0":{"text":"날씨가 맑은 밤이면 늘 지금처럼 모닥불 주위에 둘러앉아 함께 별을 보고, 재미있는 이야기를 잔뜩 나누곤 했잖아.","source_cn":"每逢天气晴朗的夜晚，我们就会像现在这样围坐在篝火旁，一...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD4ED06284ACE61DF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1820502005:0":{"text":"그... 그랬나요?","source_cn":"是……是这样吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC59D76394007A2A2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:182050200